    "baseRefName": "main",
    "body": "The original question, whether n planar points can realize n−o(n) different pinned-distance counts, remains unresolved after two approaches. This package proves scoped obstructions to generic gluing of small seeds and to configurations concentrated exactly on a line or circle, and records the remaining construction gap. No new-discovery claim is made.\n\nThe source audit recovers the exact question from a full 1995 Erdős manuscript and preserves the unavailable-source and unverified external-preprint qualifications. Only this problem’s attempt folder is changed.\n\nValidation: 18,306 author exact checks reproduce byte for byte. A separate adversarial AI review passed all stated partial assertions and added 1,263 exact checks, with no mandatory correction. The full review and reproducible controls are included. This has not undergone human peer review.\n\nDisposition: unsolved / stalled, 2 of 5 substantive attempts used.\n",
